816	// Combed flow lines (ref 05: thin bright streaks along the flow, 2–4 px apart in the mid-ground).
817	// Anti-aliased lines across the flow (K slots per unit), each broken into tapered streak segments of
818	// varying length/brightness. Line width is in PIXELS (≈1.2 px core + ≈2.5 px glow), so near the camera
819	// the slots spread apart into sparse crisp glints instead of wide parallel light stripes (the
